rts  have made a contribution to the art and  science of filmmaking and last but not  least special thanks go out to our wives  and children for all their support thank  you I just have to thank my parents who  when I was eight year old eight years  old they gave me a computer they they  still have no idea what I do have to  take my my wife Erin who was here at I  used my my biggest fan and maybe my only  fan but it's important so thank you and  also to the Academy thank you very much  thank you  [Applause]
 

